    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί-στεγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of two stories,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία, πύργος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5246
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				243.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.70
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of two chambers</i> on the same floor, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.5.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίστεγον, τό,</span>
			<i>room on the upper floor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				8.25.1
			</span></i>.</div>
